# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it"): a note, a comment, links and sheet protection, through
# s3-review's panels as typed: New Note, New Comment, Insert link (an address; a place in the
# workbook), Protect Sheet without a password.
sheet-name "Review"
enter A1 "Item"
enter B1 "Amount"
enter A2 "Desk"
enter B2 "250"
enter A3 "Chair"
enter B3 "120"
note B2 "Checked against the invoice"
comment B3 "Is this the right price?"
link A5 "https://example.com/"
link-place A6 "Review!B2"
protect
save
expect note Review!B2 *:\nChecked against the invoice
expect note Review!B3 [[]Threaded comment]*Comment:\n    Is this the right price?
expect link Review!A5 address https://example.com/ place  text https://example.com/
expect link Review!A6 address  place Review!B2 text Review!B2
expect protect Review contents formatcells False insertrows False
